Hi Stefan,

Make sure that graphviz has been installed from the rpm and not
compiled from source. Installing from rpms, when possible, makes
life with Fedora _much_ simpler.
The rpms your need to install are:
  graphviz
  graphviz-devel
Both are available from the Fedora Extras repository.
See the "Unofficial Fedora FAQ" ( http://www.fedorafaq.org/ )
for how to install stuff from the Fedora Extras repos... and for
many other very usefull tips.
Cheers,

H.


