From jmacdon at med.umich.edu  Wed Jul 12 17:48:32 2006
From: jmacdon at med.umich.edu (James W. MacDonald)
Date: Wed, 12 Jul 2006 11:48:32 -0400
Subject: [BioC] a question on creating model.matrix using limma
