From rgentlem at fhcrc.org  Tue Jul 18 01:47:11 2006
From: rgentlem at fhcrc.org (Robert Gentleman)
Date: Mon, 17 Jul 2006 16:47:11 -0700
Subject: [BioC] How to create expression data packages
