Hi Lina,

I think you have an outdated Biobase. I have Biobase 1.10.0 and it works 
with those versions of affy and affyio.

A much better (and easier) way to install packages is to use biocLite(). 
This function will download the correct version of all requested 
packages so you shouldn't run into these problems.

source("http://www.bioconductor.org/biocLite.R")
biocLite("Biobase")

It's a pain to always type the url, so I just put the source() call in a 
file called .Rprofile in my home directory, so it is always available.

